KiCad library footprints / symbols (standard SMD)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Some footprints embedded in the PCB were generated with kicad-footprint-generator
(KiCad libraries, typically CC-BY-SA 4.0 with exception for generated outputs —
see https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-footprints). Custom footprints live
under kicad/tstat.pretty/ and are part of this project's MIT-licensed work.
